# Editor configuration for data entry windows
[data_entry]
block1 = gui/input_widget.py
    - Add methods to handle basic parameter inputs and updates from GUI.
    - Define interactions with other blocks via event listeners or API endpoints.
block2 = dem/contact_model.py
    - Implement detailed logic for force calculations, collision detection, etc., based on user feedback.
    - Integrate directly with block1 to fetch input values dynamically during runtime.
block3 = main.py
    - Set up orchestration logic that listens to GUI and contact model updates to trigger simulation steps or parameter adjustments.